desc(
	mode: "struct"
	language: "golang"
	title: "Struct scan: Go crypto/rc4"
	title_zh: "结构扫描：Go crypto/rc4"
	type: vuln
	level: high
	rule_id: "struct-go-rc4"
	risk: "weak-cryptographic-algorithm"
	desc: <<<DESC
### 规则说明
检测到 crypto/rc4。RC4 已被淘汰。

### 风险类型
weak-cryptographic-algorithm

### 影响
该用法属于已知危险 API 或弱密码学配置，可能被用于绕过校验、执行代码或泄露机密。

### 检测方式
结构扫描在编译单元内匹配真实调用，而不是注释或字符串字面量。
DESC
	solution: <<<SOLUTION
### 修复建议
使用 AES-GCM。
SOLUTION
	alert_min: 1
	"file://c.go": <<<POS
package main
import "crypto/rc4"
func n(k []byte) { rc4.NewCipher(k) }

POS
	"safefile://s.go": <<<NEG
package main
func n() {}

NEG
)

rc4.NewCipher as $call
rc4.NewCipher(* as $k) as $call
alert $call for {
	level: "high",
	title: "Struct scan: Go crypto/rc4",
	title_zh: "结构扫描：Go crypto/rc4",
	message: "结构扫描：Go crypto/rc4",
	risk: "weak-cryptographic-algorithm",
}
